<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Nike Inc and HealthPlan Services Corp were unavailable for news pending.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA and LCI International were also unavailable for after-hours trading, the exchange said.</p>
</text>
